                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">(list[int]) A list of number of bedrooms for EACH Honeybee-Room input.
This should ideally be the same length as the '_hb_rooms' input, and in the same
order. If only a single value is input, that value will get applied to all of the
Honeybee-Rooms input. Note that this value is the number of bedrooms PER-HB-ROOM,
not the total number of bedrooms in the entire model.</item>
                            <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">0aebbf1c-7ce6-483e-8086-c26519eb730d</item>
                            <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">_num_bedrooms</item>
